    "imperial_superlaser_ability_name": "Full Reactor Ignition",
    "imperial_superlaser_ability_desc": "The DS-1 Orbital Battlestation's massive antimatter annihilator reactors are momentarily overcharged to fill massive capacitors capable of holding at least a week's worth of output from a yellow dwarf star. This energy is pushed through the power diversion solenoid and directed into the eight reactor lenses lining its large dish, firing a powerful beam capable of destroying the gravitational binding energy of a planet. These massive reactors also power a multitude of weapons systems and particularly resilient deflector shields. A hammer in a universe of nails.",
    "imperial_allegiance_power_surge_ability_name": "Prototype Shield Overcharge Array",
    "imperial_allegiance_power_surge_ability_description": "The Allegiance is the most powerful ship the Empire can field, thus it must be protected. A new prototype shield array was developed using enemy technology and superior Imperial designs. While the battlecruiser still has antimatter reserves, its shields will remain powerful.",
    "imperial_venator_sphat_ability_name": "SPHA-T Turbolaser",
