    "imperial_shields_strikecraft_research_subject_description": "Grand Admiral Thrawn has long championed the use of more a more robust fighter craft capable of sustaining multiple direct hits without endangering the pilot's safety. New reverse engineered alien shield technology has allowed us to place miniaturized deflector shield generators on the TIE Fighter, Interceptor, and Bomber without compromising engine or weapon power output.",
