    "imperial_unlock_planetary_shield_array_unit_item_research_subject_description": "The SLD-26 is a powerful shield generator capable of shielding entire planets from orbital bombardment. The Imperial Skunkworks was able to replicate its functionality with new rare materials found while surveying our new home.",
