    "imperial_capital_ship_starting_level_0_research_subject_description": "The ISB has identified many junior officers and enlisted personnel which have excelled at their given roles. They are to undergo extensive academic, physical, and leadership training to further increase the Imperial Navy's efficacy in combat operations.",
