    "imperial_capital_ship_starting_level_1_research_subject_description": "The ISB has identified many enterprising junior officers and seasoned senior officers to promote and give additional comprehensive leadership and tactical training, allowing our newly completed capital-class ships to fight with a far higher level of competency.",

